10. APPLICATIONS
-----------------

The proposed HiSMD-Net framework, by improving small-object detection accuracy
specifically for UAV aerial imagery, has direct applicability in:

  - Urban Traffic Monitoring: Detecting micro-vehicles and pedestrians at
    intersections and highways from drone altitude.
  - Railway & Infrastructure Surveillance: Identifying small foreign-object
    intrusions on rail surfaces or transmission lines.
  - Disaster Response: Locating micro-scale survivors or vehicles in large-
    scale aerial search-and-rescue imagery.
  - Smart City Management: Real-time crowd density estimation and vehicle
    counting in dense aerial scenes.
  - Defence & Border Surveillance: Detecting small UAV threats or personnel
    in high-altitude wide-area imagery.
